@lang en
IMPORT `vn13-art01-02-definitions`

-- Named cases for the tests. No directives here; the tests modules import this one.
-- Every figure below is a HYPOTHETICAL scenario value (a premium, a sum assured, a unit
-- price), chosen to make the arithmetic visible. None is a figure the document states; the
-- figures the document states (90%, 360%, 21 days, 60 days, ...) appear only in the rules
-- and in the expected values worked from them in the tests.

§ `Fixtures`

§§ `The contract`

-- Applied for and accepted on 10 January 2026 (the Effective Date), issued five days later.
-- Annual regular basic premium 20,000,000; riders 1,000,000 a year; sum assured
-- 500,000,000; half to the Growth Fund, half to the Balanced Fund.
GIVETH A `The Policy Schedule`
`the schedule` MEANS
    `The Policy Schedule` WITH
        `issue date`            IS YMD 2026 1 15
        `effective date`        IS YMD 2026 1 10
        `expiry date`           IS YMD 2090 1 10
        `sum assured`           IS 500_000_000
        `regular basic premium` IS 20_000_000
        `premium frequency`     IS `annual premiums`
        `rider premium`         IS 1_000_000
        `fund allocation`       IS LIST (`An allocation to a fund` WITH `fund` IS `the Growth Fund`,   `share` IS 50%),
                                        (`An allocation to a fund` WITH `fund` IS `the Balanced Fund`, `share` IS 50%)

GIVEN `the premium`   IS A NUMBER
      `the frequency` IS A `A premium frequency`
GIVETH A `The Policy Schedule`
`the schedule with a premium of` `the premium` `paid as` `the frequency` MEANS
    `The Policy Schedule` WITH
        `issue date`            IS YMD 2026 1 15
        `effective date`        IS YMD 2026 1 10
        `expiry date`           IS YMD 2090 1 10
        `sum assured`           IS 500_000_000
        `regular basic premium` IS `the premium`
        `premium frequency`     IS `the frequency`
        `rider premium`         IS 0
        `fund allocation`       IS LIST (`An allocation to a fund` WITH `fund` IS `the Growth Fund`, `share` IS 100%)

-- The Policyholder, who is the Life Insured: born 20 June 1990, aged 35 at issue.
GIVEN `the date of birth` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The Life Insured`
`a resident Policyholder born on` `the date of birth` MEANS
    `The Life Insured` WITH
        `date of birth`                         IS `the date of birth`
        `resident in Vietnam on the issue date` IS TRUE
        `the same person as the Policyholder`   IS TRUE

GIVETH A `The Life Insured`
`the Life Insured` MEANS `a resident Policyholder born on` (YMD 1990 6 20)

GIVETH A `The history of the contract`
`a clean history` MEANS
    `The history of the contract` WITH
        `date of the latest lapse or termination` IS NOTHING
        `date of the latest reinstatement`        IS NOTHING

GIVEN `the lapse`         IS A DATE
      `the reinstatement` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `The history of the contract`
`a history with a lapse on` `the lapse` `and reinstatement` `the reinstatement` MEANS
    `The history of the contract` WITH
        `date of the latest lapse or termination` IS JUST `the lapse`
        `date of the latest reinstatement`        IS `the reinstatement`

-- Charges collected over the first two years: initial charges at 90% and 70% of two annual
-- premiums of 20,000,000 (18,000,000 + 14,000,000), risk premiums 4,000,000, policy fees
-- 600,000.
GIVETH A `The charges collected`
`the charges collected` MEANS
    `The charges collected` WITH
        `initial charges collected` IS 32_000_000
        `risk premiums collected`   IS 4_000_000
        `policy fees collected`     IS 600_000

GIVETH A `The charges in the Policy Schedule`
`the charges` MEANS
    `The charges in the Policy Schedule` WITH
        `monthly policy fee`                IS 50_000
        `risk premium rate`                 IS 0.0002
        `switching fee`                     IS 100_000
        `partial withdrawal fee`            IS 200_000
        `bid-offer spread`                  IS 5%
        `fund management fee rate per year` IS 2.5%

§§ `Valuations of the account`

GIVEN `the date`        IS A DATE
      `growth units`    IS A NUMBER
      `growth price`    IS A NUMBER
      `balanced units`  IS A NUMBER
      `balanced price`  IS A NUMBER
      `the debt`        IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A valuation of the account`
`a valuation on` `the date` `: Growth` `growth units` `at` `growth price` `, Balanced` `balanced units` `at` `balanced price` `, premium debt` `the debt` MEANS
    `A valuation of the account` WITH
        `valuation date` IS `the date`
        `holdings`       IS LIST (`A holding in a fund` WITH `fund` IS `the Growth Fund`,   `units held` IS `growth units`,   `bid price` IS `growth price`),
                                 (`A holding in a fund` WITH `fund` IS `the Balanced Fund`, `units held` IS `balanced units`, `bid price` IS `balanced price`)
        `premium debt`   IS `the debt`

-- March 2030, Wednesdays. Account values 200,000,000; 211,000,000; 222,000,000.
-- Premium debt 2,000,000 from 13 March, so the surrender values are 200,000,000,
-- 209,000,000 and 220,000,000.
GIVETH A LIST OF `A valuation of the account`
`the valuations of March 2030` MEANS
    LIST (`a valuation on` (YMD 2030 3 6)  `: Growth` 10_000 `at` 15_000 `, Balanced` 5_000 `at` 10_000 `, premium debt` 0),
         (`a valuation on` (YMD 2030 3 13) `: Growth` 10_000 `at` 16_000 `, Balanced` 5_000 `at` 10_200 `, premium debt` 2_000_000),
         (`a valuation on` (YMD 2030 3 20) `: Growth` 10_000 `at` 17_000 `, Balanced` 5_000 `at` 10_400 `, premium debt` 2_000_000)

-- June 2027 to February 2028. Account values (no debt): 4 June 12,000,000; 8 December
-- 15,000,000; 12 January 13,000,000; 19 January 15,000,000; 26 January 16,000,000;
-- 2 February 14,000,000. Listed out of order on purpose.
GIVETH A LIST OF `A valuation of the account`
`the valuations of 2027 and 2028` MEANS
    LIST (`a valuation on` (YMD 2028 1 26) `: Growth` 1_000 `at` 11_000 `, Balanced` 500 `at` 10_000 `, premium debt` 0),
         (`a valuation on` (YMD 2027 6 4)  `: Growth` 1_000 `at` 7_000  `, Balanced` 500 `at` 10_000 `, premium debt` 0),
         (`a valuation on` (YMD 2027 12 8) `: Growth` 1_000 `at` 10_000 `, Balanced` 500 `at` 10_000 `, premium debt` 0),
         (`a valuation on` (YMD 2028 2 2)  `: Growth` 1_000 `at` 9_000  `, Balanced` 500 `at` 10_000 `, premium debt` 0),
         (`a valuation on` (YMD 2028 1 12) `: Growth` 1_000 `at` 8_000  `, Balanced` 500 `at` 10_000 `, premium debt` 0),
         (`a valuation on` (YMD 2028 1 19) `: Growth` 1_000 `at` 10_000 `, Balanced` 500 `at` 10_000 `, premium debt` 0)

-- The 15th anniversary of the Effective Date is 10 January 2041; the next Valuation Date
-- is 11 January 2041: Growth 10,000 units at 18,000 (180,000,000), Balanced 5,000 at
-- 12,000 (60,000,000).
GIVETH A LIST OF `A valuation of the account`
`the valuations of January 2041` MEANS
    LIST (`a valuation on` (YMD 2041 1 4)  `: Growth` 10_000 `at` 17_500 `, Balanced` 5_000 `at` 11_900 `, premium debt` 0),
         (`a valuation on` (YMD 2041 1 11) `: Growth` 10_000 `at` 18_000 `, Balanced` 5_000 `at` 12_000 `, premium debt` 0)

-- The funds' own valuations, for the prices at which premiums buy units: Growth bid 9,500
-- (950,000,000 over 100,000 units), Balanced bid 19,000; at a 5% spread the offer prices
-- are 10,000 and 20,000.
GIVETH A LIST OF `A fund on a valuation date`
`the funds on 13 March 2030` MEANS
    LIST (`A fund on a valuation date` WITH `fund` IS `the Growth Fund`,   `valuation date` IS YMD 2030 3 13, `net asset value` IS 950_000_000,   `units in issue` IS 100_000),
         (`A fund on a valuation date` WITH `fund` IS `the Balanced Fund`, `valuation date` IS YMD 2030 3 13, `net asset value` IS 1_900_000_000, `units in issue` IS 100_000)

GIVETH A LIST OF `An allocation to a fund`
`half Growth, half Balanced` MEANS
    LIST (`An allocation to a fund` WITH `fund` IS `the Growth Fund`,   `share` IS 50%),
         (`An allocation to a fund` WITH `fund` IS `the Balanced Fund`, `share` IS 50%)

§§ `Death claims`

-- A death claim, built from the parts that vary between the tests.
GIVEN `the history`                    IS A `The history of the contract`
      `the date of death`              IS A DATE
      `an offence of the Life Insured` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an offence of another person`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `AIDS-related`                   IS A BOOLEAN
      `by suicide`                     IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice date`                IS A DATE
      `the first claim date`           IS A DATE
      `the complete claim date`        IS A DATE
      `the valuations`                 IS A LIST OF `A valuation of the account`
      `the amounts after death`        IS A NUMBER
      `the rider benefits`             IS A NUMBER
      `the grace charges`              IS A NUMBER
      `the misstatement`               IS A MAYBE `A misstatement of age or sex`
      `the non-disclosure`             IS A MAYBE `A non-disclosure or misstatement`
GIVETH A `A death claim`
`a death claim on` `the history` `, death on` `the date of death` `, own offence` `an offence of the Life Insured` `, other's offence` `an offence of another person` `, AIDS` `AIDS-related` `, suicide` `by suicide` `, notice on` `the notice date` `, claim made on` `the first claim date` `, complete on` `the complete claim date` `, valuations` `the valuations` `, deducted after death` `the amounts after death` `, riders` `the rider benefits` `, unpaid in grace` `the grace charges` `, misstatement` `the misstatement` `, non-disclosure` `the non-disclosure` MEANS
    `A death claim` WITH
        `the schedule`                                          IS `the schedule`
        `the Life Insured`                                      IS `the Life Insured`
        `the history`                                           IS `the history`
        `date of death`                                         IS `the date of death`
        `caused directly or indirectly by an offence of the Life Insured` IS `an offence of the Life Insured`
        `caused directly or indirectly by an offence of another person`   IS `an offence of another person`
        `related to AIDS, ARC or HIV infection`                 IS `AIDS-related`
        `suicide`                                               IS `by suicide`
        `date the Company received notice of the death`         IS `the notice date`
        `date the claim was first made`                         IS `the first claim date`
        `date the Company received the complete and valid claim` IS `the complete claim date`
        `valuations after the death`                            IS `the valuations`
        `amounts deducted from the death to the notice`         IS `the amounts after death`
        `rider benefits payable`                                IS `the rider benefits`
        `unpaid charges of a grace period`                      IS `the grace charges`
        `the charges collected`                                 IS `the charges collected`
        `a misstatement of age or sex`                          IS `the misstatement`
        `a non-disclosure`                                      IS `the non-disclosure`
        `days of force majeure or other objective obstacle`     IS 0
        `date the Policyholder learned of the death, if the Policyholder proves not knowing of it` IS NOTHING

-- THE MAIN CLAIM. Death on Friday 1 March 2030 (policy year 5), notified 3 March, claimed
-- in full on Sunday 10 March; next Valuation Date after the claim date: 13 March, surrender
-- value 209,000,000 (account 211,000,000 less debt 2,000,000). Risk and rider premiums
-- deducted after the death 300,000; rider benefits 50,000,000.
GIVETH A `A death claim`
`the main claim` MEANS
    `a death claim on` `a clean history` `, death on` (YMD 2030 3 1) `, own offence` FALSE `, other's offence` FALSE `, AIDS` FALSE `, suicide` FALSE
        `, notice on` (YMD 2030 3 3) `, claim made on` (YMD 2030 3 3) `, complete on` (YMD 2030 3 10)
        `, valuations` `the valuations of March 2030` `, deducted after death` 300_000 `, riders` 50_000_000 `, unpaid in grace` 0
        `, misstatement` NOTHING `, non-disclosure` NOTHING

-- The main claim with one fact changed.
GIVEN `own offence`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `other offence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `aids`          IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A death claim`
`the main claim with own offence` `own offence` `, other's offence` `other offence` `, AIDS` `aids` MEANS
    `a death claim on` `a clean history` `, death on` (YMD 2030 3 1) `, own offence` `own offence` `, other's offence` `other offence` `, AIDS` `aids` `, suicide` FALSE
        `, notice on` (YMD 2030 3 3) `, claim made on` (YMD 2030 3 3) `, complete on` (YMD 2030 3 10)
        `, valuations` `the valuations of March 2030` `, deducted after death` 300_000 `, riders` 50_000_000 `, unpaid in grace` 0
        `, misstatement` NOTHING `, non-disclosure` NOTHING

GIVEN `the history` IS A `The history of the contract`
      `the claim date` IS A DATE
      `the grace charges` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A death claim`
`the main claim with history` `the history` `, first claimed` `the claim date` `, unpaid in grace` `the grace charges` MEANS
    `a death claim on` `the history` `, death on` (YMD 2030 3 1) `, own offence` FALSE `, other's offence` FALSE `, AIDS` FALSE `, suicide` FALSE
        `, notice on` (YMD 2030 3 3) `, claim made on` `the claim date` `, complete on` (YMD 2030 3 10)
        `, valuations` `the valuations of March 2030` `, deducted after death` 300_000 `, riders` 50_000_000 `, unpaid in grace` `the grace charges`
        `, misstatement` NOTHING `, non-disclosure` NOTHING

-- Early deaths, in the first two years after issue (15 January 2026 to 15 January 2028).
GIVEN `the history`       IS A `The history of the contract`
      `the date of death` IS A DATE
      `by suicide`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `AIDS-related`      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A death claim`
`an early death on` `the history` `, on` `the date of death` `, suicide` `by suicide` `, AIDS` `AIDS-related` MEANS
    `a death claim on` `the history` `, death on` `the date of death` `, own offence` FALSE `, other's offence` FALSE `, AIDS` `AIDS-related` `, suicide` `by suicide`
        `, notice on` (YMD 2028 1 16) `, claim made on` (YMD 2028 1 20) `, complete on` (YMD 2028 1 20)
        `, valuations` `the valuations of 2027 and 2028` `, deducted after death` 0 `, riders` 0 `, unpaid in grace` 0
        `, misstatement` NOTHING `, non-disclosure` NOTHING

-- Article 7 cases: the facts not disclosed could affect underwriting and were not disclosed
-- later; the Company decides to treat the contract as void on 1 February 2028.
GIVEN `affects underwriting` IS A BOOLEAN
      `fraud`                IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A non-disclosure or misstatement`
`a non-disclosure, affecting underwriting` `affects underwriting` `, fraud` `fraud` MEANS
    `A non-disclosure or misstatement` WITH
        `could affect the underwriting decision`   IS `affects underwriting`
        `not itself disclosed by the Policyholder` IS TRUE
        `about age or sex`                         IS FALSE
        `in a supplementary part of the contract`  IS FALSE
        `insurance fraud`                          IS `fraud`
        `the Company's decision date`              IS JUST (YMD 2028 2 1)

GIVEN `the date of death`  IS A DATE
      `the claim date`     IS A DATE
      `the non-disclosure` IS A `A non-disclosure or misstatement`
GIVETH A `A death claim`
`a claim for a death on` `the date of death` `, claimed on` `the claim date` `, with` `the non-disclosure` MEANS
    `a death claim on` `a clean history` `, death on` `the date of death` `, own offence` FALSE `, other's offence` FALSE `, AIDS` FALSE `, suicide` FALSE
        `, notice on` `the date of death` `, claim made on` `the claim date` `, complete on` `the claim date`
        `, valuations` `the valuations of 2027 and 2028` `, deducted after death` 0 `, riders` 0 `, unpaid in grace` 0
        `, misstatement` NOTHING `, non-disclosure` (JUST `the non-disclosure`)

-- Article 6 cases: declared born 1 January 1965; truly born on the date given.
GIVEN `the true date of birth` IS A DATE
      `the discovery date`     IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A misstatement of age or sex`
`a misstated birth date, truly` `the true date of birth` `, discovered` `the discovery date` MEANS
    `A misstatement of age or sex` WITH
        `true date of birth`                         IS `the true date of birth`
        `declared date of birth`                     IS YMD 1965 1 1
        `sex misstated`                              IS FALSE
        `date discovered`                            IS `the discovery date`
        `reasonable medical expenses`                IS 1_000_000
        `monthly deductions charged to discovery`    IS 4_000_000
        `monthly deductions at the true age and sex` IS 3_500_000

GIVETH A `A death claim`
`a claim with a misstated age` MEANS
    `a death claim on` `a clean history` `, death on` (YMD 2027 12 1) `, own offence` FALSE `, other's offence` FALSE `, AIDS` FALSE `, suicide` FALSE
        `, notice on` (YMD 2027 12 2) `, claim made on` (YMD 2027 12 5) `, complete on` (YMD 2027 12 5)
        `, valuations` `the valuations of 2027 and 2028` `, deducted after death` 0 `, riders` 0 `, unpaid in grace` 0
        `, misstatement` (JUST (`a misstated birth date, truly` (YMD 1955 1 1) `, discovered` (YMD 2027 12 6)))
        `, non-disclosure` NOTHING

§§ `Other cases`

GIVEN `the date paid` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `A regular premium falling due`
`the half-yearly premium due on 10 July 2026, paid` `the date paid` MEANS
    `A regular premium falling due` WITH
        `due date`  IS YMD 2026 7 10
        `date paid` IS `the date paid`

GIVEN `the surrender value` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The account at a monthly deduction`
`an account with a surrender value of` `the surrender value` MEANS
    `The account at a monthly deduction` WITH
        `surrender value` IS `the surrender value`
        `risk premium`    IS 100_000
        `policy fee`      IS 50_000
        `rider premium`   IS 80_000

GIVEN `the notice date`   IS A DATE
      `a benefit paid`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `documents returned` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A free-look refusal`
`a refusal given on` `the notice date` `, a benefit paid` `a benefit paid` `, documents returned` `documents returned` MEANS
    `A free-look refusal` WITH
        `date the policy documents were received`     IS YMD 2026 1 20
        `date the written notice reached the Company` IS `the notice date`
        `a benefit has been paid`                     IS `a benefit paid`
        `the original receipts and the policy documents were returned` IS `documents returned`
        `premiums paid`                               IS 21_000_000
        `medical and health-check expenses`           IS 500_000
